[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Synthesizing approved customer feedback under aggregation controls and creating internal training summaries from approved internal documentation are bounded, low-risk information-processing tasks. Promotion decisions are employment-related high-impact decisions, while diagnostic support and client-facing legal drafting involve healthcare and legal guidance, respectively; these domains require heightened safeguards and are not routine team-approved use cases merely because a human reviews the output.

