[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Data should be handled according to the organization’s classification policy, with escalation when the planned use exceeds approved sensitivity limits. Files should also be reviewed before upload so that sensitive, confidential, or regulated fields not needed for the analysis are removed or redacted. A sandboxed execution environment does not eliminate these policy and data-minimization obligations.

