[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A customer journey map is grounded in a defined persona and journey scope. Its structure is then established by identifying the persona’s major stages, followed by the touchpoints within those stages. Pain points and opportunities are evaluated at those touchpoints before all findings are synthesized into the final journey map.

