[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Description involves communicating goals clearly enough to prompt useful AI behaviors and outputs. Defining the task scope, required output format, intended audience, and applicable constraints provides the specification needed for a useful, reliable result.

