[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A focused continuation requires a usable summary before a new chat can receive its starting context. References intended for reuse should be identified and added to Project sources or attached before continuing, because Projects keep related chats, files, and instructions together to preserve context and stay on-task. The new chat can then be validated for alignment before work resumes.

