[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Only the feedback necessary for the summary should be provided, while personal contact details should be removed, redacted, or anonymized. This preserves the information needed for the task while minimizing unnecessary exposure of personally identifiable information.

