[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude Projects provide a persistent workspace with a project knowledge base whose uploaded content is used across chats within that project. Projects can also be shared with other organization members on Team and Enterprise plans, and project instructions apply to all chats in the project.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
