[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A primary or authoritative source is the strongest basis for establishing an event date and resolving a conflict between cited sources. Recency alone does not establish accuracy, dates cannot be meaningfully averaged, and an unresolved conflict should not be presented as verified fact.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A useful structured prompt progresses from the underlying task and intended audience or decision to the relevant context and constraints, followed by explicit output requirements such as length, tone, and format. The complete prompt is submitted only after those elements are defined. Anthropic guidance likewise recommends clear instructions, relevant context, and explicit expected output.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
