[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A Project’s purpose and the recurring tasks it will support establish the context for its configuration. Reference materials, project instructions, collaborator permissions, and representative testing should be chosen and assessed against that defined workload.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Effective business prompts specify the task the model is expected to perform and provide relevant context—such as the intended audience and the task goal—so the response can be targeted, appropriate, and useful.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A strong evaluation framework for a project status report verifies factual accuracy against the charter, confirms that all required reporting fields are complete, and assesses whether the content is relevant to the steering committee audience. These criteria directly support dependable reporting on committed milestones; presentation quality and structural consistency alone do not.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Project configurations should be reviewed and updated periodically because the policies, terminology, and source documents they rely on can change even before any decline in output quality is apparent.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Authorizing a connector requires governance validation: the connector must be approved by IT, and the data source’s classification and the team’s permission to use it must be confirmed. These checks establish vendor and data-access compliance before a connection is authorized.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Effective Description uses clear, purposeful communication to convey intended AI outputs and behavior. Accurate stakeholder framing should communicate what Claude can reliably produce, its known capability boundaries, and the human oversight that remains, in terms appropriate to the audience’s AI familiarity.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An ethics review should establish who may be affected and how, assess the content for fairness and accuracy problems, determine the transparency required for that audience, address or escalate identified concerns, and retain a record of the final outcome and changes.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A sound evaluation establishes the acceptance criteria before review, reads the complete business case for context, validates it against source data and required content, records deficiencies, and only then decides whether it is acceptable, needs iteration, or should be escalated.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A board memo should use consistent headings and concise wording for quick executive review, follow the organization’s standard terminology, and have every factual claim verified against source data. AI-generated content does not remove the need for independent fact checking.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Open exploratory prompting supports divergent thinking during early-stage strategic brainstorming for a new market. Rigid templated prompting supports repeatable monthly compliance reports that must conform to a fixed schema.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Skills provide specialized, repeatable procedures, while a Project’s knowledge base provides persistent reference context and its project instructions provide guidance for chats in that Project. Adding the relevant Skill, supporting knowledge sources, and aligned custom instructions combines those complementary capabilities for a recurring workflow.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude can analyze provided documentation and cycle-time data to map the current workflow, surface likely bottlenecks, and suggest optimization alternatives. Human review remains necessary because language-model outputs should be grounded in supplied evidence and validated before operational decisions are made.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Generative-model output can still contain factual errors, violate organizational policies, or fail to meet brand standards. Human review remains an important control for customer-facing material, particularly where accuracy and reputation matter; acknowledging efficiency gains while explaining those risks with concrete examples is the appropriate stakeholder response. Anthropic’s customer-support guidance recommends guardrails, fact-checking, and verification that agent responses align with company policies and known facts.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Custom instructions should state the required voice attributes and operational constraints explicitly: empathetic but formal language with no contractions, a minimum draft length, and goodwill-credit recommendations only when the attached eligibility policy authorizes them. This prevents the overly brief, casual, and policy-inconsistent outputs.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Higher-capability models are appropriate for complex, multi-step reasoning tasks such as legal analysis, where stronger reasoning quality is needed and human review can validate the result. Lighter, faster models are appropriate for routine, well-defined FAQ responses when low latency is a priority. Model selection should be based on task complexity, quality needs, cost, and latency—not price alone.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A production model evaluation needs measurable success criteria and operational constraints—including quality, latency, and expected request volume—so results can be judged against the workload’s requirements. Candidate models must also be shortlisted according to that requirements profile and their known capabilities before they are evaluated on representative traffic. Anthropic guidance calls for defining measurable success criteria before building evaluations, and AWS guidance describes benchmarking candidate models against a workload-specific evaluation set after determining the required quality and latency characteristics.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Effective stakeholder messaging requires identifying each stakeholder group and what it needs to understand, along with defining the key facts about Claude’s role and the boundaries that apply. These inputs establish the message content and audience framing before drafting begins.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude Haiku is the lightweight, fast, lower-cost tier; Claude Sonnet balances capability, efficiency, and cost for general work; and Claude Opus is the highest-capability tier for demanding, complex reasoning, with higher cost and typically greater latency.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Reasserting goals and constraints when the discussion moves to a new subtopic maintains alignment with the project’s requirements. Periodically summarizing decisions preserves the important working state in a compact form, helping the model maintain coherence as the conversation approaches context-window limits.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Confidential financial information should not be allowed to become persistent context that could be surfaced in later, unrelated sessions. Disable the conversation’s Memory contribution when using a standard conversation, or use Incognito mode to prevent the conversation from contributing to Memory. Anthropic also advises care when sharing highly sensitive financial information and confidential business documents.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An effective improvement loop captures specific feedback after each run, maps it to targeted prompt or workflow adjustments, and checks later runs for measurable improvement. Specific, timely feedback makes the cause of a change and its effect on output quality easier to evaluate.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Effective prompt-output troubleshooting first identifies the precise output defect and compares it with the prompt to establish the relevant mismatch. The resulting evidence supports a causal hypothesis, which should be tested by changing only one targeted element. Documenting the confirmed cause and resolution preserves the result for later reuse.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }When several successive prompt iterations no longer improve output quality, further revisions are producing diminishing returns. Human review or a different approach is the appropriate next step.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude is most useful for drafting and synthesizing information from many sources, where it can accelerate preparation of material while a downstream reviewer retains responsibility for validation and final judgment.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A closed feedback loop records the review feedback before selecting targeted adjustments. The adjusted cycle is then run and measured against the prior cycle; its changes and outcomes are documented so there is a basis for deciding whether to iterate further, change direction, or escalate.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Providing the organization’s glossary and requiring exclusive use of its terms gives Claude the approved vocabulary and a clear constraint to apply it consistently throughout the response.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Clear, descriptive delimiters such as XML tags separate documents, metadata, instructions, and inputs, reducing ambiguity and supporting correct source attribution. For long-context work, placing long-form reference material near the top and the task query near the end improves performance; therefore, reference-critical content should be positioned near a context boundary rather than buried in the middle.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude Memory retains work-related context for use in new conversations, and its built-in import flow can bring relevant memory from another AI service into Claude. This reduces the need to repeatedly provide the same project context across sessions.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A Project knowledge base supplies context across all chats in that Project, so it should contain the current, broadly relevant reference documents needed repeatedly for manager policy questions: the current employee handbook, leveling guide, and policies FAQ. Superseded policies and incidental historical emails can introduce outdated or unnecessary context, while recurring reference materials should not need to be attached separately to each chat.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude can sometimes hallucinate, producing text that is factually incorrect or inconsistent with the provided context despite sounding plausible or confident. Hallucination-mitigation measures cannot eliminate this risk, so critical information and high-impact customer-facing output require human review and verification.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Government identifiers and full payment-card numbers associated with identifiable people are sensitive personal and financial data. Redacting or anonymizing them reduces unnecessary exposure of personally identifiable information; public company materials and generic public product information do not create the same privacy risk.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A human–AI workflow must first define the tasks where Claude provides value and the points at which responsibility passes to a human. Those boundaries establish the workflow that can later be piloted, refined from pilot results, documented, and rolled out. Anthropic guidance likewise emphasizes keeping humans in the loop and defining organizational gates around agentic work.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Delegation involves strategically distributing work between people and AI based on the task’s nature, the system’s capabilities and limitations, and the need for human expertise and judgment. Final hiring decisions carry consequential human judgment and accountability, so they require human ownership rather than autonomous AI execution.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A hallucination is an assertion that lacks factual support or conflicts with reliable evidence. Identifying the exact unsupported claim establishes what must be verified, corrected, withdrawn, or escalated; regeneration, risk documentation, and user notification are subsequent actions. Anthropic recommends verifying claims with supporting quotations and sources, and withdrawing a claim when no supporting citation can be found.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Workflow optimization requires a baseline measurement of current quality, time, and cost, plus identification of the steps creating the greatest time, cost, or quality issues. Those diagnostics establish what to change and provide a basis for evaluating whether the revised workflow improves outcomes.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Discernment involves thoughtfully and critically evaluating AI outputs for quality, including accuracy, relevance, coherence, and appropriateness. Checking the complete brief against its requirements, underlying sources, and professional standards provides the evidence needed before it is shared.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A sound high-level decomposition begins by defining the onboarding experience’s overall objective and identifying its major phases. Those decisions establish the structure and purpose that detailed artifacts, such as exact email copy and scheduling, must follow.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Prompt refinement is most effective when it resumes from the version that most closely met the required template. That baseline preserves the successful elements and enables small, controlled adjustments instead of compounding drift.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Project instructions can define how ChatGPT should respond, including required format and audience expectations. A Project can also contain reference materials that ChatGPT uses to produce informed results, so the current policy library belongs in the policy-summary workflow. Unrelated training, legal-case, and HR-onboarding materials are outside that workflow and should not be added as its context.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A main conclusion that conflicts with the evidence in the body creates a fundamental logical inconsistency. It leaves the reader unable to determine which claim is supported, undermining the clarity and reliability of the output’s central message.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A figure repeated across secondary trade-press articles can originate from the same unverified claim. Validating it requires locating the underlying study and confirming the figure, its methodology, scope, and context in the primary source.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Sensitive fields must be identified through content classification before they can be safely redacted or replaced. This also supports the least-privilege principle: Claude should not receive sensitive information that it does not need.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Quarterly investor communications should prioritize the headline financial result early, followed by a concise explanation of its key drivers and the forward outlook. This structure makes the most decision-relevant information clear within a limited time window.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An AI governance framework sets organizational policies, processes, controls, roles, and accountability for AI throughout its use. It can define permitted tools and data, review requirements, and reporting or escalation paths so AI is used consistently, responsibly, and accountably. NIST identifies governance as establishing transparent policies, procedures, and controls, with documented roles and communication lines for AI risk management.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A strong cross-functional report is developed by defining its goals, collecting the appropriate inputs for each section, drafting those sections with focused prompts, and deriving the executive summary from the completed sections. This supports traceability to each area’s source material and ensures that the summary reflects the report’s actual findings.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Data minimization requires providing only the information needed for the intended task. Because the summary is about the issue, the government identifier and home address are unnecessary sensitive data and should be removed or redacted before submission.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Workflow integration should begin with documenting the current process so its ownership and decision points are understood. That enables appropriate allocation of Claude-assisted and human-controlled work, followed by a clear specification of inputs, outputs, and hand-offs. A limited pilot validates the integrated process and gathers feedback before the workflow is revised and rolled out broadly. Anthropic guidance similarly recommends breaking an interaction into tasks, defining success criteria, and evaluating it systematically before production deployment.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A deliverable can satisfy the presence of each required topic while still failing a topic-specific depth requirement. Renewal risk must cover pricing, product fit, and stakeholder change; addressing only one factor leaves that section under-scoped and requires expansion before delivery.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Code Execution can calculate statistics from the full uploaded dataset, create the required chart, and support verification of the computed outputs against the underlying source data before they are shared.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Effective system-level instructions begin by establishing the Project’s purpose and the boundaries that govern its behavior. Those requirements determine what the instructions should direct; drafting, validation, refinement, and distribution can occur only after that foundation is defined. Project instructions provide project-specific guidance for how ChatGPT should help within the Project.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Explicitly requesting separate categories for mandatory requirements, optional requirements, unresolved questions, and conflicts gives the model a clear output structure and preserves distinctions needed for requirements analysis. Clear, specific formatting instructions improve control over Claude’s response format.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A structured competitor-pricing summary requires research that collects comparable pricing information, identifies the sources for each finding, and records confidence or uncertainty so the team can judge how actionable the information is. This is an evidence-gathering and synthesis task, not brainstorming, a restricted single-competitor comparison, or open-ended conversation.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An unchanged customer-facing draft that makes a service-level commitment can create an external promise with contractual, operational, and financial consequences. Its direct effect on a paying customer makes human review and escalation appropriate before use. Anthropic advises review by a qualified professional before disseminating sensitive content or decisions to consumers.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Information connected to an ongoing investigation must not be entered into an AI tool under the organization’s explicit policy. The appropriate course is to withhold the information from Claude and consult HR leadership for an approved alternative process.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Controlled prompt refinement changes one identifiable variable at a time and records the resulting effect. This isolates which change caused an improvement or regression, enabling reliable learning and deliberate subsequent adjustments.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Appropriate Connector use follows least privilege, approved role-scoped access, and read-only access where writing is unnecessary. A Connector limited to an approved team project-management workspace and a read-only Connector to public reference content meet those constraints. Personnel, personal mixed-use storage, and payroll systems expose sensitive data or high-impact capabilities beyond the stated needs.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Clear, explicit instructions about the intended audience, regional scope, output length, tone, and required key messages give Claude the constraints needed to produce a suitable draft. A prior newsletter can effectively guide the requested tone without substituting for the current content requirements. Anthropic’s prompt-engineering guidance recommends clearly specifying the desired output and using relevant examples and details.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }High-impact employment decisions require human accountability because they can materially affect a person’s livelihood. Outputs that systematically disadvantage a protected group create discriminatory harm and are therefore a critical ethical concern.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A structured table makes a large, multi-region dataset easy to scan, compare, sort, and analyze because records and metrics occupy consistent rows and columns.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Explicitly enumerating the three required questions and directing Claude to answer each one makes task-completeness requirements unambiguous and reduces the risk that a required item is skipped.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Fair interview questions are job-related, avoid assumptions about protected or personal backgrounds, and can be applied consistently to every candidate. The EEOC identifies asking the same questions for a job and focusing inquiries directly on the position as practices that support nondiscriminatory treatment.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Research must begin by defining the specific questions to be answered, because they set the scope for information gathering, source validation, and the final report. Anthropic’s guidance likewise emphasizes clearly defining specific, measurable objectives before subsequent evaluation work.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Separate Claude Projects provide self-contained workspaces with project-specific knowledge and instructions. Assigning distinct context, knowledge sources, and instructions to each client engagement preserves the boundary between their work and prevents one client’s information from being used in the other engagement.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Sonnet is the balanced Claude model tier for routine work that needs solid output quality without the higher cost and latency associated with Opus. Haiku is optimized for simpler, high-speed and high-volume workloads, while Opus is intended for the most demanding reasoning tasks.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude can synthesize information across uploaded research documents to support a literature review and can turn meeting notes into a structured project-status-update draft. These are assistive drafting and summarization tasks that remain subject to human review, unlike autonomous final press approval, legally binding commitments, or sole-model employment decisions.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude is designed for language and analysis tasks, including generating text and summarizing source material. It can draft a customer-facing email using specified tone and audience requirements under human review, and its large context capacity supports synthesizing an executive summary from numerous long documents. Binding legal judgments, exact financial settlement calculations using live inputs, and real-time anomaly detection require specialized controls, authoritative data, or deterministic and accountable decision processes beyond those language-model strengths.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Project instructions apply to all chats within a Project and are intended to establish project-specific context, workflow guidelines, task requirements, and the role or perspective Claude should adopt. Including the course-designer role, the organization’s instructional-design standards, and the required lesson-outline structure provides consistent guidance for every lesson.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude can generate factually incorrect or contextually inconsistent output, and mitigation techniques do not eliminate that risk; critical information still requires validation. Appropriate stakeholder communication therefore states the integration’s limitations and known failure modes, while honestly defining Claude’s assistance role and the decisions that remain with humans.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An effective unsupported-claim review starts with a complete read-through to spot potentially questionable content, followed by identifying the exact claims, statistics, and citations requiring validation. Those items are then checked against authoritative evidence, documented when unsupported or inconsistent, and used to determine the appropriate remediation or escalation.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }An evaluation checklist requires task-relevant criteria to determine what quality dimensions are assessed and an acceptance threshold to determine whether the assessed output passes. Those definitions must exist before any score can be assigned; production routing, escalation, and audit recording are downstream activities.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A context window has finite input capacity, so removing irrelevant content keeps the available tokens focused on information needed for the task. Clear section headers delineate separate input materials and make their relationships and purposes easier for the model to interpret. Oversized inputs can otherwise require truncation or fail when they exceed the model’s input limit.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Deployment Diligence requires the human using AI to verify and vouch for outputs that will be used or shared. Professional accountability remains with the human, so identifying what needs independent verification or correction and personally owning those checks before external delivery fulfills the requirement.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Prompt iteration should be guided by explicit evaluation criteria: comparing revised output with the original criteria shows whether the change helped. Iterations are most effective when each revision addresses a specific identified weakness, rather than making arbitrary or repeated changes.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Customer segmentation should describe demonstrable customer behaviors and be validated against actual customer data, rather than applying an unsupported demographic generalization to individuals. A disclaimer or internal-only use does not correct the inaccurate underlying characterization.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Workflow optimization begins by mapping the current process, then using performance measurements to identify the bottleneck. A targeted improvement is applied to that constraint, tested in a limited pilot against the established baseline, and only then rolled out broadly with documentation.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Haiku is the appropriate model family for simple, high-volume, latency-sensitive work. Anthropic’s guidance recommends using Haiku for simple tasks and reserving more capable models for complex reasoning, so it aligns with fast interactive turns that need only light reasoning.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Delegation strategically divides work between humans and AI based on the nature and stakes of each task. Error consequence and reversibility determine whether delegation is acceptably safe, while tasks requiring human expertise, creativity, empathy, or judgment should remain human-led. The AI Fluency Framework specifically identifies human expertise, creativity, and judgment as considerations when distributing work between people and AI.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Third-party Skills should be enabled only from trusted, organization-approved sources, and their requested capabilities and access should be reviewed to ensure they are necessary and appropriate for the intended task. Public listings or favorable reviews do not substitute for validating provenance and applying least-privilege access.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Extracting and supplying only the relevant sections retains the necessary regulatory context while avoiding token consumption by unrelated chapters, preserving more context-window capacity for the task.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Prompting strategy should be adapted to the task type because different tasks require different instructions, context, output formats, constraints, and evaluation criteria. A single template cannot reliably produce equally strong results across every type of task.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A prompt that identifies only a topic leaves the intended task, audience, and response structure undefined. Those missing constraints force the model to infer essential requirements, increasing the likelihood of a generic or misaligned response.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A redacted job description and an anonymized HR-policy summary are appropriately minimized and do not contain identifiable or sensitive employee information. Employee accommodation records, identifiers and hire dates, and named salary information are confidential HR data and are unsuitable for routine prompting.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A sound use-case assessment must first scope what the use case actually is before it can be checked against anything else: identifying the audience, decision impact, and reversibility of the outputs (step 1) establishes the risk profile of the proposed use. Only with that risk profile in hand does it make sense to compare the use case against organizational policy and applicable regulatory considerations (step 3), since the relevant policies and regulations to check depend on who is affected and how consequential and reversible the outcome is. The assessment rationale is then written up for traceability (step 5) as the basis for the actual proceed/modify/decline determination (step 4), with the specific data types and sensitivity involved (step 2) treated as the final implementation-level check. Sequences that place the policy/regulatory comparison (step 3) or the documentation step (step 5) before the audience/impact/reversibility scoping (step 1) are incoherent, because they require checking a use case against policy or writing up its rationale before its risk profile has even been established.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A representative example gives Claude a concrete standard for the desired response, including its tone and level of detail. Explicitly naming the desired tone and a specific audience also supplies actionable constraints that guide style, vocabulary, and appropriate depth. Anthropic recommends clear, explicit instructions and notes that Claude pays attention to details and examples.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Ambiguous feedback should be clarified before it is applied so that revisions reflect the reviewer’s intended meaning. Linking every feedback item to its corresponding change creates an auditable revision trail and helps confirm that feedback has been addressed. Claude-generated content should still be reviewed and verified rather than treated as automatically correct.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude can synthesize information from stakeholder interviews and process documents into a structured requirements set. Source traceability makes each requirement auditable against the underlying input, helping analysts validate the result and reduce unsupported claims. Anthropic’s documentation supports analyzing supplied documents and generating citations that point to specific source locations.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Requirements conflicts should be explicitly documented with traceability to each originating source and returned to the relevant stakeholders for resolution. This preserves accountability and prevents an analyst or AI tool from making an unauthorized business decision.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude’s model lineup generally trades efficiency for capability: lighter models such as Haiku are intended for simpler, fast, lower-cost work, while more capable models such as Sonnet and Opus are used for more complex reasoning and have higher token pricing and resource consumption. This supports the general pattern of greater rate-limit use and slower execution for more capable models.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Claude Code Execution can run code in a secure sandbox, process uploaded files, and perform complex calculations. That makes it the appropriate feature for reproducible computations across a multi-tab spreadsheet.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }When a prompt contains several required items, explicitly numbering or otherwise enumerating each item makes the required coverage unambiguous and helps ensure that each is answered in sequence. Combining all three questions into a comma-separated paragraph leaves the task structure insufficiently explicit.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }A focused revision incorporates the specific stakeholder feedback while retaining content that was already accepted. Documenting the changes also makes the subsequent review clearer and more traceable.

[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-yellow) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, #000); color: #ffffff; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-green) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, #fff); color: #172033; }
[data-question-highlight-id="question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb"]::highlight(question-marker-R16ajmlfiv5tpfiv5uadb-pink) { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, #fff); color: #172033; }Source materials must be gathered and labeled before consolidation so each requirement remains traceable. The consolidated material is then submitted to Claude with a structured extraction prompt; the extracted requirements can subsequently be grouped and reviewed for conflicts or ambiguities. Validation against the original sources must occur before documenting the final, traceable requirements set. Anthropic’s citations documentation supports providing documents to Claude and retaining source references for verification.

